igate to help icons","2. Tab to help icons","3. Verify focus indicators","4. Press Enter/Space","5. Verify tips appear"],"expectedResults":["Help icons keyboard accessible","Icons have accessible names","Icons have role='button'","Focus indicators visible","Icons activate with Enter/Space"],"postconditions":"Help icons are keyboard accessible","testResult":"PASS"},{"id":"TC_A11Y_039","title":"Verify help icon screen reader accessibility","wcagCriterion":"4.1.2 Name Role Value","componentElement":"Help Icons","priority":"Highest","relatedJiraIssue":"SCRUM-22","preconditions":"Edit form is open with screen reader enabled","steps":["1. Enable screen reader","2. Navigate to help icons","3. Verify icon announced","4. Trigger tooltip","5. Verify tooltip announced"],"expectedResults":["Icon role announced","Icon name announced: 'Help' or 'Accessibility tip'","Tooltip triggered by focus and hover","Tooltip content announced","Escape dismisses tooltip"],"postconditions":"Screen reader correctly announces help icons","testResult":"PASS"},{"id":"TC_A11Y_040","title":"Verify help tip content accessibility","wcagCriterion":"1.4.3 Contrast","componentElement":"Help Tips Content","priority":"High","relatedJiraIssue":"SCRUM-22","preconditions":"Help tip is displayed","steps":["1. Open help tips","2. Review tip content","3. Verify text contrast","4. Test zoom to 200%","5. Test tip dismissal"],"expectedResults":["Tips provide clear guidance","Examples: 'Write effective accessibility-compliant content'","Tips have 4.5:1 contrast","Tips readable at 200% zoom","Tips keyboard dismissible"],"postconditions":"Help tip content is accessible","testResult":"PASS"},{"id":"TC_A11Y_041","title":"Verify complete keyboard navigation","wcagCriterion":"2.1.1 Keyboard","componentElement":"Overall Edit Interface","priority":"Highest","relatedJiraIssue":"SCRUM-22","preconditions":"User is on the edit product page","steps":["1. Navigate entire edit workflow","2. Tab through all elements","3. Verify tab 